# Entropy agent contract

Before any product or UI change:

1. Read `AGENTS.md`
2. Read `PRODUCT.md`
3. Read `DESIGN.md`

Follow those documents over habit or generic SaaS patterns.

## Non-negotiables (summary)

- Local-first: never own/import user files; workspace = folder; notes = Markdown on disk
- Palette only: `#131413` `#1C1D1C` `#FAFAF9` `#C8C8C6`
- Font: Geist only (Inter solely if Geist unavailable)
- Notebook: no Linked/extra side panels; context panel hides when empty
- Layout: three columns, resizable, remembered, collapsible
- Icons (Lucide) for obvious chrome; calm 150–200ms motion; whitespace over borders
- Obsidian writing × Refern organization — do not clone either
- Protected OS paths: never trash/rename/move/write under system trees; skip them in duplicates/storage scans
